WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.773 --> 00:00:19.795
gasped as dinosaur skeletons stomped through the museum, their bones rattling.

2
00:00:19.815 --> 00:00:24.377
"N-n-nobody panic!"

3
00:00:24.437 --> 00:00:25.358
Mr. Freaky yelled.

4
00:00:25.378 --> 00:00:28.879
"Everything is totally under control!"

5
00:00:29.719 --> 00:00:31.020
"No, it's not!"

6
00:00:31.596 --> 00:00:32.657
Dr. Bones cried.

7
00:00:33.877 --> 00:00:35.938
A stegosaurus lumbered toward her.

8
00:00:35.958 --> 00:00:39.420
"What have you monsters done?"

9
00:00:41.762 --> 00:00:47.665
Ben saw a big dinosaur stomp into the Early Humans exhibit and roar at a stuffed mammoth.

10
00:00:48.525 --> 00:00:51.627
The stegosaurus was now drinking from the fountain in the lobby.

11
00:00:54.288 --> 00:00:59.291
A tall beast was munching on the plastic palm trees at the entrance to the Egyptian exhibit.

12
00:00:59.311 --> 00:01:04.182
"Help!" screamed Al Normal as the stegosaurus charged toward him.

13
00:01:05.903 --> 00:01:09.586
"Stop!" Ben commanded, floating in front of the dinosaur.

14
00:01:10.527 --> 00:01:12.748
But the stegosaurus ran right through Ben.

15
00:01:13.429 --> 00:01:14.689
Winnie jumped on her broom.

16
00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:18.392
She zoomed toward Al Normal and yanked him out of the way.

17
00:01:22.955 --> 00:01:23.595
Fix this!"

18
00:01:23.615 --> 00:01:26.357
"My spell book is upstairs!"

19
00:01:26.978 --> 00:01:27.758
Waldo moaned.

20
00:01:27.778 --> 00:01:29.900
"All I have is a wand."

21
00:01:31.252 --> 00:01:36.236
"Yay!" whooped a skeleton who was hanging onto the tail of the big dinosaur.

22
00:01:36.976 --> 00:01:38.418
Mr. Freaky and Dr.

23
00:01:38.478 --> 00:01:41.039
Bones ducked as the dinosaur ran by them.

24
00:01:41.059 --> 00:01:43.181
"Do something, Mr.

25
00:01:43.281 --> 00:01:45.903
Freaky!" the museum director commanded.

26
00:01:46.643 --> 00:01:48.325
Mr. Freaky blew his noses.

27
00:01:53.548 --> 00:01:54.169
he bellowed.

28
00:01:54.189 --> 00:01:56.611
"Do something!"

29
00:01:56.631 --> 00:02:02.869
"No!" Cleo yelled at the stegosaurus as it charged toward the mummy display case.

30
00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:06.410
"Stay away from my uncle."

31
00:02:06.991 --> 00:02:11.052
She grabbed Waldo's wand and cried, "Spell, begone!"

32
00:02:11.892 --> 00:02:16.433
Magic sparks flew from the wand—and the dinosaur froze in its tracks.

33
00:02:16.453 --> 00:02:20.815
"Why didn't I think of that?"

34
00:02:21.355 --> 00:02:22.175
muttered Waldo.

35
00:02:23.015 --> 00:02:24.436
Winnie was still on her broom.

36
00:02:26.332 --> 00:02:30.055
She took the wand from Cleo and flew around the museum, waving it.

37
00:02:30.896 --> 00:02:31.636
Zap! Zap!

38
00:02:31.837 --> 00:02:35.640
Zap! Soon all the dinosaurs were lifeless bones again.

39
00:02:39.603 --> 00:02:41.604
Mr. Freaky dusted off his suit.

40
00:02:41.624 --> 00:02:43.066
"You see?"

41
00:02:43.566 --> 00:02:44.467
he said to Dr.

42
00:02:44.507 --> 00:02:47.429
Bones. "Everything is totally under control."

43
00:02:50.712 --> 00:02:55.636
"I think this is enough excitement for one day," Miss Bungle announced.

44
00:02:56.476 --> 00:02:57.536
She checked her watch.

45
00:02:57.556 --> 00:02:59.517
"It's nearly dinnertime.

46
00:02:59.997 --> 00:03:02.778
Why don't we return to the education wing and eat?

47
00:03:03.678 --> 00:03:05.678
Then we can settle down for the night.

48
00:03:06.219 --> 00:03:09.439
I'm sure by tomorrow everyone will feel much better."

49
00:03:09.459 --> 00:03:11.800
"But what about Uncle Tut?"

50
00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:13.220
Cleo protested.

51
00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:15.181
"They're keeping him prisoner!"

52
00:03:15.201 --> 00:03:18.002
"He's not a prisoner," Dr.

53
00:03:18.042 --> 00:03:21.263
Bones snapped, "and he's not your uncle.

54
00:03:22.003 --> 00:03:23.423
He's an exhibit.

55
00:03:23.943 --> 00:03:26.104
He's been with us for decades."

56
00:03:26.856 --> 00:03:28.137
Cleo folded her arms.

57
00:03:28.157 --> 00:03:31.418
"Well, he's been my uncle for centuries!"

58
00:03:31.438 --> 00:03:36.060
"We're not going to solve this tonight," Miss Bungle said.

59
00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:39.561
"Cleo, let's talk about this again in the morning."

60
00:03:39.581 --> 00:03:41.902
"That's a fine idea."

61
00:03:42.343 --> 00:03:43.603
Dr. Bones scowled.

62
00:03:44.884 --> 00:03:46.404
"I must get back to work.

63
00:03:47.565 --> 00:03:50.886
Now I have to check on the dinosaur exhibits as well."

64
00:03:50.906 --> 00:03:53.407
"I'm sorry."

65
00:03:53.927 --> 00:03:55.068
Waldo hung his head.

66
00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:57.961
"It was an accident," he murmured.

67
00:04:00.181 --> 00:04:03.762
Back in the education wing, the monsters ate dinner quietly.

68
00:04:07.423 --> 00:04:10.404
After dinner Al Normal led them to the movie theater.

69
00:04:14.485 --> 00:04:19.006
"Students, this is an absolutely thrilling documentary."

70
00:04:19.026 --> 00:04:22.047
"Goody!" yelled a goblin.

71
00:04:22.067 --> 00:04:24.108
"What's the film about?"

72
00:04:24.448 --> 00:04:25.248
Mog asked.

73
00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:28.621
"The history of glaciers."

74
00:04:29.481 --> 00:04:32.842
"Ugh!" All the monsters groaned.

75
00:04:32.862 --> 00:04:37.623
"That sounds so boring," Mog complained.

76
00:04:37.643 --> 00:04:39.644
"Now, students!"

77
00:04:40.044 --> 00:04:41.784
Mr. Freaky leaped to his feet.

78
00:04:42.604 --> 00:04:43.985
"We are guests here.

79
00:04:44.425 --> 00:04:46.225
Show your monster manners, please."

80
00:04:47.566 --> 00:04:49.606
The lights went out and the movie started.

81
00:04:51.127 --> 00:04:52.987
Al Normal hurried off to help Dr.

82
00:04:53.027 --> 00:04:54.988
Bones lock up the building for the night.

83
00:04:57.024 --> 00:04:59.945
Ben stared at the massive chunks of ice on the screen.

84
00:05:01.285 --> 00:05:02.866
They were actually kind of interesting.

85
00:05:03.586 --> 00:05:04.766
He turned toward Mog.

86
00:05:04.786 --> 00:05:09.167
"I never knew that—" Zzzz.

87
00:05:09.187 --> 00:05:11.648
Zzzz. Mog was already snoring.

88
00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:22.731
With a sigh, Ben turned back to the screen.

89
00:05:24.451 --> 00:05:26.832
After the movie the monsters had a snack.

90
00:05:28.072 --> 00:05:31.073
Then the kids started telling spooky people stories.

91
00:05:32.913 --> 00:05:35.154
A goblin finally burst into tears.

92
00:05:38.075 --> 00:05:40.836
"I'm scared!

93
00:05:41.616 --> 00:05:42.996
I want my mommy!"

94
00:05:43.016 --> 00:05:47.358
"Bedtime, everyone!"

95
00:05:47.798 --> 00:05:50.258
Mr. Freaky said, clapping his hands.

96
00:05:51.979 --> 00:05:55.340
Soon all the monsters were settled into their beds for the night.

97
00:05:55.956 --> 00:05:58.278
The girls were in one classroom with Miss Bungle.

98
00:05:59.018 --> 00:06:00.700
The boys were in another with Mr.

99
00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:04.522
Freaky. "Ha-ha!"

100
00:06:05.063 --> 00:06:06.924
Mog was laughing as he poked Ben.

101
00:06:06.944 --> 00:06:09.046
"Check out Mr.

102
00:06:09.106 --> 00:06:16.951
Freaky's Waldo climbed into his sleeping bag.

103
00:06:16.971 --> 00:06:20.033
"Mr. Freaky, what about Cleo's uncle?"

104
00:06:20.434 --> 00:06:20.974
he asked.

105
00:06:20.994 --> 00:06:23.276
"We can't just leave him here."

106
00:06:24.204 --> 00:06:26.626
"We'll talk about it in the morning," Mr.

107
00:06:26.686 --> 00:06:27.366
Freaky said.

108
00:06:27.386 --> 00:06:30.168
"I'm sure the people will be reasonable."

109
00:06:30.188 --> 00:06:33.111
"They haven't been reasonable so far."

110
00:06:33.931 --> 00:06:34.772
Waldo sighed.

111
00:06:34.792 --> 00:06:36.933
"Poor Cleo."

112
00:06:39.875 --> 00:06:42.137
Ben was sleeping near a desert display.

113
00:06:44.679 --> 00:06:46.760
It had friendly-looking birds and snakes.

114
00:06:48.502 --> 00:06:51.404
Mr. Freaky's snores echoed through the quiet room.

115
00:06:54.448 --> 00:06:57.190
Most of the other monsters fell asleep fast too.

116
00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:00.211
But Ben kept tossing and turning.

117
00:07:00.231 --> 00:07:05.334
"So far this field trip has been a disaster," he thought.

118
00:07:05.354 --> 00:07:08.156
"No wonder people are afraid of monsters."

119
00:07:09.776 --> 00:07:11.117
Even worse, Dr.

120
00:07:11.177 --> 00:07:14.739
Bones was going to tell Mayor Hubbletree about the dinosaur incident.

121
00:07:15.319 --> 00:07:18.801
Soon Monster Academy would be nothing but a pile of rubble.

122
00:07:19.642 --> 00:07:23.424
Just then Ben heard something moving on the other side of the room.

123
00:07:25.888 --> 00:07:28.816
A shadowy figure was creeping toward the classroom door.

124
00:07:30.019 --> 00:07:32.626
The door opened, and the figure slipped out.
